       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DATEOPS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CURRENT-DATE PIC X(26).
       01 WS-DATE-YYMMDD PIC 9(6).
       01 WS-DAY PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-TIME PIC X(8).
       01 WS-INTEGER PIC 9(9).
       01 WS-DATE-CONV PIC X(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           ACCEPT WS-CURRENT-DATE FROM DATE.
           DISPLAY WS-CURRENT-DATE.

           ACCEPT WS-DATE-YYMMDD FROM DATE YYYYMMDD.
           DISPLAY WS-DATE-YYMMDD.

           ACCEPT WS-DAY FROM DAY.
           DISPLAY WS-DAY.

           ACCEPT WS-TIME FROM TIME.
           DISPLAY WS-TIME.

           COMPUTE WS-INTEGER = FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(20261121).
           DISPLAY WS-INTEGER.

           MOVE FUNCTION DATE-OF-INTEGER(WS-INTEGER) TO WS-DATE-CONV.
           DISPLAY WS-DATE-CONV.
           STOP RUN.
